use flake

# Canonical IaC binary for this repo is OpenTofu (tofu). Both `terraform`
# and `tofu` ship in the dev shell (inherited from
# nix-devenv.devShells.<system>.terraform). The env var below forces
# terragrunt to dispatch to `tofu` so the OpenTofu lockfile format
# (registry.opentofu.org/...) stays canonical whether checks run locally
# or in CI.
#
# The `terraform-format` and `terraform-validate` pre-commit hooks come
# from cachix/git-hooks.nix (via nix-devenv's flakeModules.terraform),
# which uses `pkgs.opentofu` directly — PCT_TFPATH is no longer needed.
export TERRAGRUNT_TFPATH=tofu
